#
# Addresses of the old WordPress site, answered with a real 301, read by
# Cloudflare Pages at deploy time. A Zola alias would have served a page that
# redirects with a script, which a search engine treats as a weaker signal and
# which the Content-Security-Policy in _headers would block anyway.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/index.php/download/           /download/       301
/index.php/download            /download/       301
/index.php/category/news/      /news/           301
/index.php/category/news       /news/           301
/index.php/donate/             /support/        301
/index.php/donate              /support/        301
/index.php/contribute/         /get-involved/   301
/index.php/contribute          /get-involved/   301
